### VS Code "REST Client" extension. Start the backend, then click "Send Request".

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### ---------- ACCOUNTS ----------

### Create (role: student, teacher or admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "student", "fName": "Juan", "lName": "Dela Cruz", "email": "juan@school.edu", "username": "2024-0001", "password": "Student123", "yearLevel": "2nd Year", "section": "BSIT-2A" }

### List all (add ?role=student to filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Get one
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### Update (send only what changes)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lName": "D. Dela Cruz", "section": "BSIT-2B" }

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### Login (email or school ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "juan@school.edu", "password": "Student123" }

### ---------- ROLES ----------

### List
GET {{baseUrl}}/roles

### Create
POST {{baseUrl}}/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roleName": "Coordinator" }

### Rename
PUT {{baseUrl}}/roles/4
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roleName": "Advisor" }

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/roles/4
